      "body": "## Summary\r\n- Add `padding_mask` to `MultiTokenPredictionLayer._checkpointed_forward`.\r\n- Forward the rolled padding mask through the recompute custom forward, TE checkpoint, tensor-parallel checkpoint, and block fallback paths.\r\n- Add unit coverage for full recompute forwarding so the signature mismatch is caught.\r\n\r\n## Root Cause\r\n`MultiTokenPredictionLayer.forward()` passes `padding_mask` to `_checkpointed_forward()` when full recompute is enabled, and `_proj_and_transformer_layer()` already accepts and forwards that argument. The rewritten `_checkpointed_forward()` signature did not accept `padding_mask`, causing `TypeError: MultiTokenPredictionLayer._checkpointed_forward() got an unexpected keyword argument 'padding_mask'`.",
      "changedFiles": 2,
